# Agent skills live in .agents/skills/ and are exposed to Claude Code through NTFS
# junctions in .claude/skills/, which is the only directory it discovers. Git walks
# into a junction, so committing this would store a second copy of all 239 files.
# The junctions are local plumbing; recreate them from .agents/skills/ after cloning.
.claude/skills/
